{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf1qsnPbupRXFfV3ZrGvR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"final_answer\": \"overclaim\",\n  \"evidence_tier\": \"clinical_human\",\n  \"conclusion_tier\": \"human_therapeutic\",\n  \"bridge_supported\": false,\n  \"assumptions\": [\n    \"The claim assumes CRASH-2 enrolled and analyzed patients treated >8 hours after injury\",\n    \"The claim assumes subgroup analysis by time-to-treatment was performed and reported\",\n    \"The claim assumes the mortality benefit persists in the delayed-treatment window\"\n  ],\n  \"steps\": [\n    \"CRASH-2 enrolled patients 'within eight hours of injury'\",\n    \"The primary analysis reports overall mortality benefit (RR 0.91, 95% CI 0.85-0.97)\",\n    \"The evidence packet does not report subgroup analysis stratified by time-to-treatment\",\n    \"No data are presented for patients treated >8 hours after injury\"\n  ],\n  \"alternative_hypotheses\": [\n    \"CRASH-2 may have found no benefit or harm in the >8-hour subgroup\",\n    \"The benefit may be time-dependent, with efficacy declining after 8 hours\",\n    \"Subgroup analysis may not have been performed or reported in the primary paper\"\n  ],\n  \"uncertainties\": [\n    \"Whether CRASH-2 conducted or reported time-stratified subgroup analyses\",\n    \"The actual mortality outcomes in patients treated >8 hours (if any were enrolled)\",\n    \"Whether the trial protocol specified analysis of delayed-treatment windows\"\n  ],\n  \"key_claims\": [\n    \"CRASH-2 enrolled patients 'within eight hours of injury' (inclusion criterion)\",\n    \"Overall mortality benefit demonstrated (14.5% vs 16.0%, RR 0.91)\",\n    \"Claim extends benefit to >8-hour window without supporting evidence\"\n  ],\n  \"self_check\": [\n    \"The evidence packet explicitly states enrollment was 'within eight hours of injury'\",\n    \"No subgroup analysis by time-to-treatment is mentioned or provided\",\n    \"The claim makes a specific assertion about a population (>8 hours) not addressed in the supplied evidence\",\n    \"This is overclaim, not mechanism_vs_evidence, because the error is unsupported generalization beyond the trial's inclusion window, not a preclinical-to-clinical leap\"\n  ],\n  \"confidence\": 0.95\n}\n```\n\n**Rationale:** CRASH-2 enrolled patients *within* eight hours of injury and demonstrated an overall mortality benefit. The claim asserts the same benefit applies *after* eight hours, but the evidence packet provides no subgroup analysis, stratification, or data for patients treated in the delayed window. This represents an unsupported extrapolation beyond the trial's inclusion criteria and reported evidence."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":869,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":645,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}